  equation: CH3COOH + NaHCO3 -> CH3COONa + H2O + CO2
  effectId: effervescence_co2
  safetyNotes: Never seal vessel during CO2 evolution.
  educationalOutcome: Demonstrates weak acid-carbonate reaction and gas evolution.
